     "settings": {
      "html": "<ul class=\"d2u-list\"><li><strong>Stage Design</strong><br>Layouts, sightlines, and structure for concerts and theater.</li><li><strong>Rigging Safety</strong><br>Load calculations, hardware, and industry safety standards.</li><li><strong>Lighting Installation</strong><br>Fixtures, power, and rigging for compelling live looks.</li><li><strong>Event Production</strong><br>Run-of-show, crew coordination, and gear management.</li><li><strong>Live Broadcast Setup</strong><br>Integrate staging with streaming and multi-cam setups.</li></ul>"
